The holiday data in this directory (holidays.json) is taken from
date-holidays by commenthol, https://github.com/commenthol/date-holidays,
and is available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
license, http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/, as the data
relies on Wikipedia articles. The required attribution lines are kept
inside holidays.json.

The Hijri and Hebrew calendar tables (hijri.json, hebrew.json) are
generated by date-holidays-parser, ISC license, see ../../NOTICE.
The lunisolar and equinox tables are generated by this project from
astronomical computation.

VERSION.json records the upstream commits the files were built from.
